-- FORWARD declarations for the theta kernels of the compact lift that
-- layer 5 names (ThetaKernelRaises). The CM theta functions, their Taylor
-- series and the sigma function (Lib/CM/Sigma, Lib/CM/LocalHeight) are
-- defined in GRH.CM.Sigma and GRH.CM.CurveTheta; the Schur jets, Weyl
-- indices and row charges (Lib/GLn, Lib/Weil/Construction/DataProduct.lean)
-- in GRH.GLn.Tableaux; this module imports them for its users.
-- Source: grh-compact/src/New/Curve/ConjugatesOfJets.lean (Kernel.raises),
-- Lib/Weil/CompactLift/BranchingPeriod.lean (thetaKernel).
-- Part of the GRH blueprint (layer 5, the argument).
